                        "review": "It's crazy how one badly done mechanic can ruin a game.  The morale system in this game pigeon-holes you into burst damage builds only.  You will lose every siege where you don't burst things down because the Morale meter is time-based and when it runs out you flee.  There's no way to extend the meter other than destroying obstacles, so if you don't do bursty damage, you just run out of time nearly every fight.  It's genuinely a bad design and it's core to gameplay.",
